      "sourceText": "实物静止时，三个轴合起来的大小应接近1 g。雷达倾斜安装后，重力会分到多个轴上，不要求某一个轴必须等于1，也不要求另外两个轴都为0。这里的 `acc_norm` 与 `gravity` 长度约9.81并不冲突：一个对应原始读数单位，一个对应内部米制计算。",
      "translatedText": "When the physical object is stationary, the combined magnitude of the three axes should be close to 1 g\\. After the radar is installed at an angle, gravity will be distributed across multiple axes; it is not required that any one axis must equal 1, nor that the other two axes must both be 0\\. Here, `acc_norm` and `gravity` having a length of approximately 9\\.81 do not conflict: one corresponds to the raw reading unit, and the other corresponds to the internal metric calculation\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 198,
        "outputTokens": 106,
        "costUsd": 0.000187
